<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta name="viewport"
          content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Privacy Policy | SpaniCentral</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/uploads/logo.png">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/privacy.css">

</head>

<body>

    <%- include("partials/navbar") %>

    <section class="page-header">

        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p>Your privacy matters to us.</p>

    </section>

    <section class="policy-container">

        <h2>Introduction</h2>

        <p>

            SpaniCentral respects your privacy and is committed
            to protecting your personal information. This policy
            explains how we collect, use and protect information
            when you use our website.

        </p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

        <ul>

            <li>Name</li>

            <li>Email Address</li>

            <li>Messages submitted through our contact form</li>

            <li>Information automatically collected by cookies and analytics tools</li>

        </ul>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>

        <ul>

            <li>Respond to enquiries.</li>

            <li>Improve our website.</li>

            <li>Maintain website security.</li>

            <li>Provide customer support.</li>

        </ul>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>

        <p>

            SpaniCentral uses cookies to improve your browsing
            experience and remember your preferences. Third-party
            services  may also use cookies
            to display relevant advertisements.

        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

        <p>

            We may use  third-party services to operate our website.
            These services may collect information according
            to their own privacy policies.

        </p>

        <h2>Data Security</h2>

        <p>

            We take reasonable steps to protect your personal
            information from unauthorized access, alteration
            or disclosure.

        </p>

        <h2>Your Rights</h2>

        <p>

            You may contact us at any time if you wish to
            access, update or delete the personal information
            you have shared with us.

        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>

        <p>

            If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy,
            please contact us through our Contact page.

        </p>

    </section>

    <%- include("partials/footer") %>

    

</body>

</html>